158
00:26:00,354 --> 00:26:01,854
みんな初めてって言ってる…
Everyone's saying it's their first time...

159
00:26:02,104 --> 00:26:05,404
あ、じゃあ、ソロライブ初体験の人！
Ah, then people experiencing a solo concert for the first time!

160
00:26:06,354 --> 00:26:08,404
結構多いってこと？
Does that mean there's quite a lot of you?

161
00:26:08,854 --> 00:26:11,154
今までも来ているよって人！
People who have been to my live shows before!

162
00:26:12,804 --> 00:26:14,604
あ、ありがとうございます！
Ah, thank you so much!

163
00:26:15,604 --> 00:26:20,204
すごいですね。いろんな人が集まっているこのライブ、素晴らしいよ！
It's amazing. Having so many different people gathered for this concert is wonderful!

164
00:26:20,354 --> 00:26:21,504
わーい！
Yay!

165
00:26:22,904 --> 00:26:25,204
飲み物飲みます
I'm going to take a drink.

166
00:26:41,554 --> 00:26:42,854
配信…
The stream...

167
00:26:45,904 --> 00:26:58,454
そういうわけで、なんと無料配信はYouTubeのここまでとなります！
And so, surprisingly, the free stream on YouTube ends right here!

168
00:27:00,254 --> 00:27:02,704
えーと言われてもね？
Hehe, even if you say "Eee"...

169
00:27:02,904 --> 00:27:06,354
続きは概要欄から見てください！
Please check the description box to watch the rest!

170
00:27:11,804 --> 00:27:15,904
それでは、次の曲いってみようか！盛り上がっていくよー！
Well then, shall we move on to the next song? Let's get hyped!

171
00:27:26,054 --> 00:30:06,116
[Text: 無料パートは終了いたしました！ご視聴ありがとうございました！★ライブチケットのご購入は概要欄より★]
[Text: The free portion has ended! Thank you for watching! ★Purchase your livestream ticket via the link in the description★]

172
00:30:06,062 --> 00:30:20,110
[Text: 無料パートは終了いたしました！ ご視聴ありがとうございました！]
[Text: The free portion has ended! Thank you for watching!]

